# Secrets directory
# This directory contains encrypted secrets managed by agenix
# Files ending in .age are encrypted with age encryption
#
# To add a new secret:
# 1. Create the file: echo "secret-value" > secrets/my-secret.age
# 2. Encrypt with agenix: nix run github:ryantm/agenix -- -e secrets/my-secret.age
# 3. Add recipients in secrets.nix
#
# NEVER commit unencrypted secrets!
